            "type": "Hero",
            "band": "plain",
            "bleed": "full",
            "variant": "statement",
            "copy": {
              "headline": "An academy for people who want to lead where they live.",
              "subheadline": "Short courses on the work of a local organization: meetings, volunteers, money and speaking up. Watch at your own pace; the Academy keeps your place."
            },
            "media": {},
            "links": []
          },
          {
            "id": "About-about",
            "type": "About",
            "band": "tint",
            "bleed": "full",
            "variant": "letter",
            "copy": {
              "heading": "Why we teach",
              "body": "Most of what it takes to run a good meeting, keep a team together or ask for support is learned on the job, from someone who did it before you. These courses are that someone, in short lessons you can watch on a lunch break.\n\nSign in with your email and the Academy remembers where you stopped in every course. Some courses are for members; the rest are free with your email."
            },
            "media": {},
            "links": []
          },
          {
            "id": "QuoteStrip-about",
            "type": "QuoteStrip",
            "band": "wash",
            "bleed": "full",
            "variant": "single",
            "copy": {
              "heading": ""
